  "legend_notes": [
    "The paper's whole write path is LLM-bound: eight of the fifteen steps are separate model calls, and the paper never reports how many calls an episode costs.",
    "B4 shows all five rerankers Zep offers. They are mutually exclusive — one runs per query — so only RRF is wired; the other four sit in the same lane as alternatives.",
    "B5 SELECT is empty on purpose: the paper has no quota or combinatorial selection, only a top-k cut. B8 LOOP is empty because §3 is a single function composition, not an iterative search."
